        "observed": "Actually inspected the exterior image at the supplied 960×1280 preview (scaled to the browser viewport). Warm ochre/cream masonry, broad pale central dome on a windowed drum, lower semicircular roof tiers, corner domes/turrets, two tall slender shafts with projecting balcony rings and long pointed spires. Foreground Citadel walls/buildings are separate host context. The picture does not fix exact plan dimensions, heights or hidden court architecture."
