        "observed": "Actually inspected the 960×641 image. Open pale paved court, round-arched colonnade with paired slender supports and small pale roof cupolas. Central fountain has a low masonry enclosure under an octagonal canopy with broad overhang, eight arched supports and a low pale cap/finial. Square green/brown clock tower rises above the far colonnade with a white circular dial and open upper pavilion. Historical appearance reference only; no claim that fine finishes or fixtures are current. Fine decorative paint, inscriptions, metalwork and visitors will not be copied."
